From 1999ebca57e38c3d9ecd12ce4c13b28416f820dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zed-patches <zed-patches@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:24:35 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] settings_ui: the Secrets page speaks pt-BR

The Secrets page (0162) reads its text through zeo_i18n's t! from
locales/<language>/secrets.ftl, in en-US and pt-BR: the intro, the command
example's placeholder, the list's empty, loading and locked states, Copy
Reference and Delete, the three fields' placeholders, Save and the outcome
banners. The en-US file is the page's English byte for byte. The page's
title in the settings navigation stays English, as the Agent Sandbox page's
does; errors from the keyring itself (secret_vault, oo7) are shown as they come.

In the ai-jail group, after 0179: the page is 0162's, in that group.
---

